1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,666
The reaction is reversible, so the sulphuric acid acts both as catalyst and as a water remover.

2
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:10,065
Primary alcohols esterify fastest.

3
00:00:10,065 --> 00:00:16,132
With an acid chloride instead of the acid, the reaction is fast and goes to completion.

